  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance for the Victims of Colonia Dignidad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An assistance fund for individual support is being established with the goal of mitigating the negative impact on the victims from their time in the Colonia Dignidad (Chile). Assistance is provided to victims that now live on the grounds of what is the Villa Baviera, others in other parts of Chile and in Germany.  Support from the fund primarily covers the areas of health (particularly psychotherapy and psychosocial assistance, preventive care and rehabilitation, travel expenses for visits to doctors, etc.) and care as well as education (including further training and qualification measures) and employment. Additional forms of individual support may be defined in cases of severe hardship.</narrative>
  </description>
